Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.38,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the city\N在城市中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the voices of the ancients\N我听见远古的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're calling for us\N它们在召唤我们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear their horses running up Prince Street\N听见他们的马蹄踏过王子街
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.43,0:00:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm a mystic, I swim in waters\N因我是神秘者 游于深水之中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That would drown so many other bitches\N那深水足以溺毙无数庸人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me lifted, feeling so gifted\N让我升华 感受天赋恩赐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In the gym, I'm exorcising\N在健身房 我驱除心魔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All my demons, make 'em keep riding\N所有恶魔 令其永世骑行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday I lifted your body weight\N昨日我举起你体重的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I pick a song and I listen to it\N我选一首歌 反复聆听
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Till it's just a piece of music\N直至它化为纯粹音符
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything else falls away\N其余万物皆消散
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, whenever you'd break me\N亲爱的 每当你击碎我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd watch it happen, like an angel looking down\N我静观其变 如天使俯视人间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me a woman, being hurt like that I can feel\N这般伤痛让我成为女人 真切可感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It don't need fantasy\N无需幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, if she could see me now\N噢上帝 若她此刻能看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you find a another starlet\N愿你找到新星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another camera another red carpet\N新的镜头 新的红毯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.55,0:01:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As for me I'm going back to the clay\N至于我 我将回归尘土
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell them I went crazy If that's what this is\N若这算疯狂 尽管说我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll take it\N那我甘之如饴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I bring the pain out the synthesizer \N我用合成器释放痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.95,0:02:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The bodies move like there's spirits inside 'em\N身躯舞动 似有灵魂附体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.05,0:02:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, whenever you break me\N亲爱的 每当你击碎我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd watch it happen, like an angel looking down\N我静观其变 如天使俯视人间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It made me a woman, being hurt like that\N这般伤痛让我成为女人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel, don't need fantasy\N真切可感 无需幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.83,0:02:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, if she could see me now \N噢上帝 若她此刻能看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, if she could see me now\N噢上帝 若她此刻能看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, if she could see me now\N噢上帝 若她此刻能看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, if she could see me now\N噢上帝 若她此刻能看见我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:02:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God\N噢上帝
